<Layout
  title="Blog de Salud - Artículos Médicos y Bienestar | AutaMedica"
  description="Artículos de salud escritos por médicos. Telemedicina, cardiología, salud mental, dermatología y más. Contenido confiable basado en evidencia científica."
  canonical="https://www.autamedica.com/blog"
  ogImage="/images/seo/og-main.webp"
  robots="index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"
>
  <Navbar />
  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="seo-hero">
      <h1>Blog de Salud</h1>
      <p class="seo-subtitle">
        Artículos confiables sobre telemedicina, bienestar y salud, escritos por profesionales médicos certificados.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Articles Grid -->
    <section class="seo-section">
      <div class="seo-container">
        <div class="seo-grid-3">
          {articles.map((article) => (
            <article class="seo-card blog-card">
              <div class="blog-card-image">
                <img src={article.image} alt={article.title} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </div>
              <div class="blog-card-content">
                <div class="blog-card-header">
                  <span class="seo-badge">{article.category}</span>
                  <span class="blog-read-time">{article.readTime}</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="blog-card-title">{article.title}</h2>
                <p class="blog-card-excerpt">{article.excerpt}</p>
                <div class="blog-card-footer">
                  <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-card-author">{article.author}</span>
                    <span class="blog-card-date">{article.date}</span>
                  </div>
                  <a href={`/blog/${article.slug}`} class="blog-read-more">Leer artículo →</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Newsletter CTA -->
    <section class="seo-section blog-newsletter">
      <div class="seo-container">
        <div class="blog-newsletter-content">
          <h2>Recibe Artículos de Salud Cada Semana</h2>
          <p>Suscríbete a nuestro newsletter para recibir contenido médico confiable, directamente en tu email.</p>
          <form class="blog-newsletter-form">
            <label for="newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email para suscripcion</label>
            <input
              id="newsletter-email"
              type="email"
              placeholder="Tu email"
              required
              autocomplete="email"
            />
            <button type="submit" class="seo-btn-primary">Suscribirse</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '../../styles/seo-landing.css';
  
  /* Blog index card specifics */
  .blog-card { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }

  .blog-card-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--au-surface);
  }

  .blog-card-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform var(--au-transition-smooth);
  }

  .blog-card:hover .blog-card-image img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .blog-card-content { padding: var(--space-6); }

  .blog-card-header {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .blog-read-time {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--au-text-tertiary);
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .blog-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    color: var(--au-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .blog-card-excerpt {
    color: var(--au-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .blog-card-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--au-border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .blog-card-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .blog-card-author {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-medium);
    color: var(--au-text-primary);
  }

  .blog-card-date {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--au-text-tertiary);
  }

  .blog-read-more {
    color: var(--au-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: var(--font-medium);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .blog-read-more:hover {
    color: var(--au-text-primary);
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .blog-newsletter-content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .blog-newsletter-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  .blog-newsletter-form input {
    flex: 1;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    background: var(--au-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--au-border-hover);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--au-text-primary);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }

  .blog-newsletter-form input::placeholder {
    color: var(--au-text-tertiary);
  }

  .blog-newsletter-form input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--au-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .blog-newsletter-form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
